  "description": "*\"Why don't we ------ ?\"*\n\nJung Dahoon laughed out loud at a joke his longtime friend Gu Junhee made. However, Junhee had a strange expression on his face. After that day, their relationship, which was nothing more than steady friends, began to drift in a different direction. Can they be more than just friends? \n\nA soft and endlessly sweet BL of one's youth starts now~ ♡♡\n\n(Source: Bookcube, translated)\n\n*Note: includes 1 extra chapter.*",
